{
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start_s": 4.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Hello. Right, well, let's talk for a bit, actually, just to..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 9.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "just to try and clarify that I am actually sane."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 13.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, okay, so we're on..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 16.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "we've started number six."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 18.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Number six, um..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 21.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "final one."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 25.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Yeah, we've got 40... maybe 45 km to go."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 30.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, we're doing really well. So, what happened in the last one?"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 34.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, the last one, I lost my mind, basically, overnight."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 38.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, the problem is listening to stuff, audiobooks or whatever."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 44.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I mean, I had to take it off. I mean, I have no..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 47.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "nothing to run on."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 49.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, it distracts your brain, and you end up in this weird, like, hybrid..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 56.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "sleepy state where you've got, like, sort of stuff from the book and then just other random thoughts going around, and it's..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 63.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "nothing corresponds to reality. So, yeah, so I forgot how my watch works, basically."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 70.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, I had... I get massive déjà vu when I'm really sleep-deprived, so I kept thinking, like, I was just going around in a loop."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 80.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, and then I had a moment of clarity. So what I think was happening is I was sort of, like, just daydreaming and just switching off for a bit."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 88.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "And then I came round and then looked at my watch, and I literally had just been going around in circles,"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 94.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "um, like, away from the actual line that I was meant to be following."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 98.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, so, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 100.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, but luckily, when you get lost and stuff like that, it does actually jolt you back to reality for a bit."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 105.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Right, so what then happened?"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 107.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Then the sun came up and stuff, and I became a bit more sane."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 111.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, met the guy behind me."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 113.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, nice guy. He's done lots of things before, but this is a different length, the other one, this Legends tour."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 119.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, his legs are hurting a bit, but he's far more sane than me because he's had sleep, so he's got an advantage."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 125.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Anyway, so then at the checkpoint, I didn't change my socks and shoes, which is possibly rash, but I..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 131.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I put new shoes on for the last one, and you can't use everything, so they're feeling pretty good."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 136.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, and then just got out quickly."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 138.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I've just had music on, and I've basically lost my mind. I was..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 143.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "rather than an ultra runner following his line on a map to do a race,"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 148.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I convinced myself that I was running an AI company and I was meant to be leading the data scientists to..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 157.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "to the map to do the AI map."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 161.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "It's amazing that I'm, like, still surviving."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 165.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Jesus. Um..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 168.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I think I've just done so many of these that I..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 172.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I just operate on automatic despite my best efforts to sabotage myself."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 177.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Mad. Um, yeah, so I've got a really... I kept coughing lots, probably coughed too much, my voice is going, sore throat."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 185.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "And then also, um, gave myself a nosebleed as well, so that was rubbish."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 190.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Um, yeah, so anyway, we're doing well, so I'm just gonna... I'm gonna put the music away,"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 195.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "and I'm just gonna try running and focusing on the watch for a bit and staying sane, because..."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 201.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "yeah, we need to make the most of the daylight, basically, because nighttime's gonna be tough."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 206.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Hopefully there won't be too much nighttime."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 208.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Hopefully make good progress in what's left of the day."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 212.0,
      "speaker": "wearer",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Okay, bye."
    }
  ]
}

